    "instant-architecture-probe": "Inspect one unvisited architecture path for a demonstrated owner or contract defect and repair it only when authorized.",
    "instant-backend-probe": "Trace one backend operation for a reachable defect, verify its durable effects and repair it only when authorized.",
    "instant-bug-fix-polish": "Find and, when authorized, fix one demonstrated bug at its defining owner, then verify the failure and a valid control.",
    "instant-frontend-probe": "Inspect one frontend state or interaction for a real user-visible defect and repair it only when authorized.",
    "instant-ui-ux-visual-probe": "Render and inspect one interface state for a demonstrated visual or interaction defect, with before/after evidence for an authorized repair.",
    "release-artifact-trust-check": "Verify final release bytes, expected digest, signature or provenance and the trusted build/publication identity.",
    "patch-checking": "Review the complete resulting patch against intended behavior and its original comparison base; repeat after authorized corrections until clean or blocked.",
    "serverless-invocation-check": "Verify required and deferred work, response lifetime, retries and effects on the actual serverless adapter/runtime boundary.",
    "evolution-improvement": "Prioritize evidence-backed improvement opportunities with an expected outcome, tradeoffs and an actionable next decision.",
    "iteration-closure": "Assess the selected iteration against acceptance evidence and return done, next slice, replan or blocked.",
    "map-synthesis": "Reconcile repository maps against current source owners while preserving stable IDs and exposing conflicting or stale claims.",
    "synthesis": "Consolidate overlapping findings into distinct corrections with acceptance evidence, dependencies and unresolved decisions.",
    "task-shaping": "Turn a requested outcome into an executable brief with scope, owner, acceptance, dependencies and a verification plan.",
    "validation-clarification": "Validate whether a brief is ready to execute; resolve available facts and expose only decisions or evidence that actually block it.",
    "web-boundary-check": "Verify server HTML, hydration, navigation, serialized data, trusted server actions and directly affected caches in the actual framework.",
    "behavior-check": "Verify the selected behavior using explicit criteria, a distinguishing failing case, a valid control and observable results.",
    "map-refresh-polish": "Correct proven stale map entries against current sources while preserving useful structure and stable IDs.",
    "map-staleness-check": "Compare selected map entries with current source owners and classify their freshness with evidence.",
